#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:239
msgid "企業管理員的天生權限"
msgstr "The natural authority of Organization Admin"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:240
msgid "企業管理員（ORG_ADMIN）天生持有本企業內所有「企業級」和「模組級」權限，無需透過角色指派。"
msgstr "Organization Admin (ORG_ADMIN) naturally holds all \"Organization level\" and \"module level\" permissions in this Organization, and does not need to be assigned through Role."

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:241
msgid "這代表："
msgstr "This means:"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:243
