msgid "企業建立時自動產生 admin 帳號。建議盡快建立個人管理員帳號後停用此預設帳號，儀表板會持續提醒。"
msgstr "The admin account is automatically generated when Organization is created. It is recommended to create a personal administrator account as soon as possible and then deactivate this default account. The dashboard will continue to remind you."

