msgid "停用（is_active=false）：帳號無法登入但資料保留，可隨時恢復。刪除（is_deleted=true）：軟刪除，資料保留但完全不可見。"
msgstr "Deactivated (is_active=false): The account cannot be logged in but the data is retained and can be restored at any time. Delete (is_deleted=true): Soft delete, the data is retained but completely invisible."

