msgstr "Security ID"

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:435
msgid "系統內部用於識別資源的隨機字串，取代可猜測的流水號"
msgstr "A random string used within the system to identify resources, replacing guessable serial numbers."

#: app/templates/pages/platform_help/org_admin.html:440
